      "description": "Architect and lead developer for Roll Shop Management systems used at dozens of steel and aluminum roll shops across the U.S.\n\nEngage dozens of heavy industry customers: conduct initial remote system demonstrations, on-site workflow analysis, requirements discussions, system design proposals, through final on-site commissioning and training.\n\nDesign and implement web-based responsive applications that interface with a variety of production floor equipment, RFID systems, level 2 production, and level 3 business systems.  \n\nProvide performance, financial, and historical data analysis reporting previously unavailable due to lack of a central software bridging a multitude of equipment data outputs and existing production control systems.\n\nDesign cross platform and device agnostic systems capable of running on desktops, tablets, or phones sized screens.\n\nProvide real time notification and plant overview systems through websocket connected web clients.\n\nOffline Xamarin cross platform mobile FIRE and HVAC inspection applications that sync up to a central repository when back online.",
